    "# 1. Setup\n",
    "**Baseline 1: Independent CNNs.** Two separate CNNs. One predicts the crop, the other predicts the disease.\n",
    "A pair score is log P(crop) + log P(disease), so unseen pairs get a score too."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "cell-1",
